{
	"name": "Fiendish Aspect",
	"type": "feature",
	"img": "icons/sundries/flags/banner-standard-moon.webp",
	"system": {
		"description": "<p><strong>Passive Effect:</strong> You gain 60ft of Darkvision and resistance to damage from Non-magical weapons.</p><p><strong>Active Effect: </strong><em><strong>Blade’s Kiss.</strong></em> If you’re wielding a bladed weapon, you can channel your Aspect into the blade as a Bonus Action, before making a melee attack. On a hit, the target must make a Constitution Saving Throw against your Maneuver DC or take 2d10 psychic damage. You will regain hit points equal to the damage the target takes. On a success, the target only takes damage from the regular hit, and you don’t regain any hit points.</p>",
